		{
			description: [
				"&5Hullbreakers&r 是一种罕见、巨大、中立的水生生物，可在 &9Abyssal Chasm&r 的任何地方生成。它们有 &o&b400&r &2HP&r。"
				""
				"&5Hullbreakers&r will target any mobs that emit a &o&bbright glow&r from their bodies, including those affected by &eGlowing&r and any players inside &aSubmarines&r with their &o&bfloodlights&r on. They track their &o&binterest in targets&r on a scale from &o&b0-6&r. When a &5Hullbreaker&r notices a target, it adds &o&b5&r to its interest, causing its eyes and photophores to pulse. If the target is within &o&b17&r blocks, it will also stare while slowly tilting its head from side to side for &o&b3&r seconds."
				""
				"任何引起&5Hullbreaker&r兴趣的&aSubmarines&r都会开始发出声纳信号，并使控制面板闪烁。发现目标后，&5Hullbreaker&r会进入检查阶段，围绕目标至少&o&b6&r秒，然后再次凝视，重复此阶段。"
				""
				"如果完成相当于&o&b2&r个检查阶段，就会增加&o&b1&r点兴趣。一旦兴趣达到&o&b6&r，就会直接攻击目标。如果玩家或其他生物攻击了&5Hullbreaker&r的躯干，它会立即增加&o&b6&r点兴趣并反击；但由于是&o&b多部件&r生物，击中其他地方则不会攻击。如果目标逃脱，&5Hullbreaker&r会&n立即失去所有兴趣&r。"
				""
				"死亡时，&5Hullbreaker&r会一边哀嚎，一边从口中吐出掉落物——若在陆地上，则会发出呻吟声来吐出掉落物。"
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "ftbquests:custom_icon"
				tag: {
					Icon: "kubejs:item/hullbreaker"
				}
			}
			icon_scale: 1.2d
			id: "140F8AAD3B5ACD7F"
			min_width: 400
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "1BAA874AA77D3F62"
